  <description>&lt;p&gt;One day I want to learn how to use the old &lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/YUI_Library&quot;&gt;YUI Library&lt;/a&gt; and write up a post about it. :yui_happy:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I remember seeing sites use it everywhere as a curious kid in the 2000’s and I do wonder what it was like to work with it when it was like &lt;em&gt;the&lt;/em&gt; contemporary web framework. (I assume painful; I like to clown on shit like Angular but I remember what the jQuery days were like :yuideadinside:).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I kind of just want to have a whole “history of &lt;a class=&quot;hashtag&quot; data-tag=&quot;webdev&quot; href=&quot;https://prismst.one/tag/webdev&quot; rel=&quot;tag ugc&quot;&gt;#webdev&lt;/a&gt;” section on my site; I find some of the weird old stuff in this domain to be kinda fascinating.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
